                        options: ['It was stolen', 'The owner drove it into a lamp-post', 'It broke down on the highway', 'It was hit by another car'],
                        answer: 1,
                        explanation: '文中说 "I drove it into a lamp-post."（我把汽车撞在电线杆上了。）'
