                title: 'Lesson 82 - I had...',
                passage: "What did you have for breakfast yesterday, Tom? I had eggs and toast. What about you, Ann? I had cereal and milk. What did you have for lunch? I had a sandwich and an apple. Did you have a good dinner? Yes, I did. I had roast beef and potatoes. It was delicious. What did you have? I had fish and chips. It was very nice. When did you have dinner? I had dinner at seven o'clock. I had dinner at half past six.",
                passageCn: '汤姆，你昨天早饭吃了什么？我吃了鸡蛋和烤面包。你呢，安？我吃了麦片粥和牛奶。你午饭吃了什么？我吃了一个三明治和一个苹果。你晚饭吃得好吗？是的，吃得很好。我吃了烤牛肉和土豆。味道好极了。你吃了什么？我吃了鱼和炸土豆片。非常好吃。你什么时候吃的晚饭？我7点钟吃的晚饭。我6点半吃的晚饭。',
