                id: 'lc1_77',
                title: 'Lesson 122 - Who(m) did you...?',
                passage: "Who did you meet yesterday? I met a friend of mine. Who(m) did you speak to? I spoke to my teacher. Who(m) did you see at the party? I saw many people. I saw Tom and Mary. Who(m) did you write to? I wrote to my grandmother. She lives in another city. Who(m) did you invite to dinner? I invited the new neighbours. They are very nice. Who(m) did you phone this morning? I phoned the doctor. I needed an appointment. Who(m) did you buy that book for? I bought it for my sister. It is her birthday tomorrow.",
                passageCn: '你昨天遇见了谁？我遇见了我的一个朋友。你跟谁说话了？我跟我的老师说话了。你在聚会上见到谁了？我见到很多人。我见到了汤姆和玛丽。你给谁写信了？我给我奶奶写信了。她住在另一个城市。你邀请谁来吃晚饭了？我邀请了新邻居。他们人很好。你今天早上给谁打电话了？我给医生打了电话。我需要预约。你买那本书是给谁的？我给我妹妹买的。明天是她的生日。',
