                        q: 'What happened to the man in the end?',
                        options: ['He was set free', 'He had to pay 3,500 pounds', 'He got a free ticket', 'He was sent back to London'],
                        answer: 1,
                        explanation: '文中说 "The man was ordered to pay 3,500 pounds for the cost of the trip."（此人被责令支付3,500英镑的旅费。）'
