                        options: ['To talk to the conductor', 'To get a good view of the countryside', 'To get off quickly', 'Because there were no other seats'],
                        answer: 1,
                        explanation: '文中说 "I sat in the front of the bus to get a good view of the countryside."（我坐在汽车的前部，以便饱览农村风光。）'
